================================================================================
Simulation → Scenarios → Compare: sandbox vs live graph overlay
================================================================================

Context: Results only compares the sandbox before-picture with its own after-
picture. Builders also need to see what a ready sandbox would change relative to
the live graph as it is now, on the same scope, with the live side either
inferred (union view) or asserted only. New "Compare" sidebar item under
Simulation → Scenarios draws one colour-coded Sigma graph (unchanged / added
(sandbox only) / removed (live only)) with exact KPIs and a details panel. The
scope is the set of subjects materialised in the sandbox (resolved slice plus
hypothetical entities), so both sides are read for exactly the same entities.

Changes:

1. src/back/objects/simulation/CompareGraph.py (new)
   Projects a live-vs-sandbox triple diff (reusing ``Diff.compute``) into
   ``{nodes, edges, summary}``. URI links become edges; ``rdf:type`` and
   literals become node type / changed attributes. Payload capped at 400 nodes /
   1500 edges (changed nodes first); summary counts stay exact.
2. src/back/objects/simulation/Simulation.py
   ``compare_to_live`` reads sandbox triples + origins, reads live triples of the
   same subjects in batches (inferred or asserted-only relation), and returns the
   projected graph; non-ready scenarios return an empty graph.
3. src/back/objects/simulation/__init__.py
   Export ``CompareGraph``.
4. src/api/routers/internal/simulation.py, src/api/routers/simulation.py
   ``GET /simulation/{id}/compare`` and ``GET /api/v1/simulations/{id}/compare``
   (``include_inferred`` query flag; read-only / Viewer).
5. src/front/config/menu_config.json, src/front/templates/simulation.html
   New ``compare`` menu item and ``#compare-section``.
6. src/front/templates/partials/simulation/_sim_compare.html (new)
   Scenario / live-source pickers, KPI strip, legend, graph canvas, details panel.
7. src/front/static/simulation/js/simulation-compare.js (new)
   Lazy-loads graphology + Sigma, builds the overlay graph with ``--db-status-*``
   tokens, deep link ``?section=compare&simulation=<id>&inferred=0|1``.
8. src/front/static/simulation/css/simulation.css
   Canvas, details panel and legend swatch styles (design tokens only).
9. src/front/templates/partials/dtwin/_query_api.html,
   src/front/templates/partials/layout/help_modal.html
   OpenAPI card for the compare endpoint; Help Center lists Compare.
10. docs/user-guide.md, docs/architecture.md, docs/development.md
    Document the Compare section, endpoint, files and sidebar order.
11. tests/units/simulation/test_simulation_compare.py (new)
    ``CompareGraph`` projection (status, origin, node presence, cap) and
